# Proft, Sinister Mastermind's ruling: cast from the graveyard, there must be seven *other* cards there. Proft, discarded
# to its own ability on turn 1, and six Dark Rituals make seven cards in Bot1's graveyard on turn 7, but only six others:
# under Yawgmoth's Will Proft cannot be cast from there, while a Dark Ritual can (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Ornithopter
Proft, Sinister Mastermind
Dark Ritual x4
Dark Ritual x2
Yawgmoth's Will
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

